            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "can confirm just ran into this issue aswell today. caught me off gaurd not that big of a deal but heres where i ran into it, if it helps\n\n```\nreturn {\n\t\"echasnovski/mini.nvim\",\n\tversion = \"*\",\n\tevent = \"VeryLazy\",\n\tconfig = function()\n\t\t-- CUSTOM TEXTOBJECTS:\n\t\t-- local ai = require(\"mini.ai\")\n\t\t-- local custom_txtobj = {}\n\n\t\t-- MINI.COMMENT\n\t\tlocal miniclue = require(\"mini.clue\")\n```\n\ntyping `dingc`, `digc`, `dgc` all did nothing when my cursor was above or inside the comment block.\n\nmini.comments config:\n-- MINI.COMMENT\nrequire(\"mini.comment\").setup()",
